contentText:
Gleeks may have been delighted when Glee &#8216;s official social media channels announced on Oct. 21 that the musical dramedy would be returning for a reboot. Despite the good news for fans, show cocreator Ian Brennan warned that it&#8217;s not going to be all good times when the show returns.

